{
  "E17": {
    "id": "E17",
    "title": "扣下的药箱",
    "placeId": "camp",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "营地入口的送药车被巡界盾手扣下。他要追讨运输行的旧账，却拦住了居民已经付清的药品。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "营地入口的铁栅栏只开了半扇。送药车停在警戒线内，几只封好的药箱被一面拼接盾挡住。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "药箱上的收货单我核过了。居民已经付了钱，让车进去。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "warden_shield",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "运输行欠营地一批货。今天不把旧账说清楚，什么都不能搬走。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "你扣的是居民的药。那笔货款，找收钱的人追。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "warden_shield",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "车一进营地，运输行又能说已经送到了。上回我就是这么信的。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "封条和签收单都能留底。把盾让开，我们把这几箱交到收货人手里。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "盾手扫了一眼箱上的名字，仍将盾底压在车轮前，短锤敲了敲盾沿。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "warden_shield",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "我守着这个入口。这次得按我的规矩来。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "那我先替等药的人把路清出来。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "盾沿滑离车轮。盾手扶住栅栏，掉落的短锤停在他够不到的地方。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "warden_shield",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "……行，车推走。运输行欠的账还没完。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "账你另找人算。今天这批药，按箱上的名字交。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}将送药车推出警戒线，按委托单核对完药箱和封条，入口重新让出了通路。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "warden_shield"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B17"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    }
  },
  "E18": {
    "id": "E18",
    "title": "一条消息卖两遍",
    "placeId": "bar",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "酒馆里有人反复兜售早已取消的货运情报。核对过的两份委托单，连漏写的船号都一模一样。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "吧台上摊着两张货运情报单，日期相差三天，船号却在同一个位置少了一位。卖消息的人还坐在后排。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "码头已经回话了。这班船早停了，你今晚还在卖它的消息。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "chip_broker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "我只是牵线。船什么时候开，不由我定。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "第一笔投诉是前天。把售卖记录交出来，买过的人得知道。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "chip_broker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "你替谁出头？名字给我，我可以单独照顾。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "先把记录打开。退款让买家自己跟你算。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "掮客伸手来接情报单，指缝中的筹码却转过半圈，露出一圈薄刃。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "chip_broker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "单子留下，今晚的事就到这里。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "手拿开。你走之前，先把这笔生意说清楚。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "最后一枚筹码从掮客指间滑落。她看了看出口，将随身终端放上桌面。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "chip_broker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "记录都在里面，买家的联系方式也有。别把终端砸了。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "打开售卖页面。让老板娘留份底，再通知买家。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "终端上的售卖记录与两张单据对上了号。{主角姓名}将记录留在吧台，划去了这批已经失效的货运情报。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "chip_broker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B18"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    }
  },
  "E19": {
    "id": "E19",
    "title": "墙里的磨牙声",
    "placeId": "hive",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "公共线路被拖进墙缝筑巢，维修工具也遭到袭击。支路已经断电，先清开电缆槽，才能继续维修。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "蜂巢城寨的走廊只亮着应急灯。拆开的墙板旁放着维修委托，支路断电的标牌压在工具箱上。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "断电标牌在，住户也避开了。先看看什么东西占着线槽。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "一截铜线缓缓缩进墙洞，随后传出细密的磨牙声。洞边的钳柄上留着两排深深的齿痕。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "连钳子都咬。难怪没人敢伸手。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "两只钩爪搭上线槽边缘。线鼠拖着沾满金属屑的尾巴挤出墙洞，门齿间还夹着半截铜线。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "线都让你搬走了。后面的配电箱可不能再给你钻。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}绕到配电箱前。线鼠压低身体，尾巴扫过地面，掉落的铁片在窄廊里接连作响。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "来这边。把墙洞让出来。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "线鼠松开铜线，拖着尾巴退入废管道，钩爪的刮擦声渐渐远去。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "走了。先把这个破口封住。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}将委托里备好的铁网压在洞口，固定住边缘。散落的铜线被拨到一旁，电缆槽重新露了出来。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "剩下交给维修员。重新送电前，还得把每根线查一遍。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "mutant_mouse"
        }
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B19"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    }
  },
  "E20": {
    "id": "E20",
    "title": "无人认领",
    "placeId": "hotel",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "寄存室里多出了一只没有登记的旅行箱。它不断挪动位置，还会把客人的行李拖进货架底下。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "末班车旅馆的寄存室挂着暂停取件的牌子。一只贴满旧站点贴纸的旅行箱歪在货架下，旁边散着断开的行李带。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "登记本里没有你。被拖走的包倒都在这里。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}拿出寄存室交付的识别牌。箱侧的橙灯亮起，底部轮子向她转了半圈。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "luggage_lurker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "提货码匹配。目标转运。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "这牌今天才换。你在等谁来取？",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "箱底伸出四条扁平支腿。张开的箱盖猛然夹向识别牌，金属固定扣在半空撞出一声脆响。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "根本不认人。原来是套偷运东西的装置。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "luggage_lurker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "目标移动。执行回收。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}把识别牌抛向没有行李的空地，拔出武器。箱体转过来，轮子在地板上划出两道黑印。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "箱体侧翻，轮子空转几圈后停住。支腿缩回底座，松开的箱盖露出磨损的电机与夹具。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "luggage_lurker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "驱动断开。转运中止。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "就留在这儿，别再通电。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}按寄存清单将散落的行李归到空架，把停机的箱体推入维修隔间，取下了门上的暂停取件牌。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "luggage_lurker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B20"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
