  "E21": {
    "id": "E21",
    "title": "自愿签名",
    "placeId": "church",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "侧廊看守者扣下了反悔申请者的证件，把登记意向当成不可撤销的承诺。委托要求取回证件，结束这次强迫。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "科技教会侧廊的登记台上压着一叠证件。委托单写明了其中一份的编号，申请者已经要求退出，证件却始终没能取回。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "这份编号对上了。本人已经撤回申请，把证件交出来。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "penitent_ascetic",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "每个人到这里都会害怕。我当年也一样，熬过去就好了。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "登记表只说明来问过。他现在不愿意继续。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "penitent_ascetic",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "仪式都准备好了。临到门前就转身，他永远也迈不过去。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "这是他的身体。什么时候迈过去，由他自己定。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "苦修者将证件压回登记台后，收紧手里的长链。挂在链末的空心义手擦过地面，堵住侧廊出口。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "penitent_ascetic",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "你今天带不走它。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "那就先把路让出来。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "长链松落在地，苦修者扶着登记台跪坐下来。{主角姓名}取出编号相符的证件，逐页核对。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "penitent_ascetic",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "我不是要害他。我也是这样熬过来的。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "那是你的经历。不能替他签第二次字。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}带着完整证件走出侧廊，将扣留证件的情况与委托回执一并交回。登记台旁的长链没有再拦住出口。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "penitent_ascetic"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B21"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    }
  },
  "E22": {
    "id": "E22",
    "title": "钩住的维修料",
    "placeId": "junkyard",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "垃圾场出口的维修料被拾荒钩客截走。他把已经分拣封好的材料藏进背架，拒绝归还。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "垃圾场出口留着一辆翻倒的料车。委托照片里的编号扎带挂在长钩上，同批维修料露出背篓边缘。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "找到了。扎带的编号和清单一致，把维修料放回车上。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "scavenger_hooker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "在垃圾场里捡到的东西，谁钩出来就归谁。",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "这批早就分拣封好了。你从出口料车上拿的，不是从废堆里捡的。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "scavenger_hooker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "他们一车拉走，我忙一晚上也剩不下什么。就当分我一点。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "要谈回收工钱，拿工单去谈。居民等着修抽水机，这批料得送回去。",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "钩客将手里的小齿轮塞进背篓，腕上的线轴咔哒一响。长钩横到料车前，钩尖扯紧了最后一根扎带。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "scavenger_hooker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "有本事，自己拿。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "把钩放下。别把剩下的也扯坏了。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "钩杆脱手落在地上。钩客扶住背架，三根弯管相互撞响，篓里的维修料散在了脚边。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "scavenger_hooker",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "都在这儿……那枚齿轮也还你。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "按清单装回去。缺哪一件，维修队都开不了工。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}核对编号，将维修料重新扎牢放回料车。钩客收起空背篓，退开了通往出口的窄道。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "scavenger_hooker"
        },
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B22"
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "finish": {
        "id": "finish",
        "type": "finish",
        "effects": []
      }
    },
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": null,
      "endDay": null
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    }
  },
  "E23": {
    "id": "E23",
    "title": "太阳之下",
    "placeId": "tower",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "第二周第七天，诺斯在沃斯大楼发布街区封锁令。进入顶层，解除封锁。",
    "demoNote": "一阶段诺斯及双金手；二阶段至高敕令。",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "refreshTimeRange": {
      "startDay": 7,
      "endDay": 7
    },
    "refreshWeekRange": {
      "startWeek": 2,
      "endWeek": 2
    },
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "沃斯大楼外的广播反复播放封锁令。顶层大厅里，诺斯站在控制终端前，两只金色巨手悬在他的肩后。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_02",
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "撤掉街区封锁。送药的人和回家的工人都在楼下等着。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_03"
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "noss",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "你今天修开的路，明天就会成为新的冲突。城市需要同一个命令。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_04"
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "那就处理冲突。别把所有人锁在门外。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_05"
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "noss",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "他们把麻烦写成委托交给你，把明天交给别人。到最后，总得有一个人替他们决定。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_06"
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "我接的是委托，不是替人过一辈子的授权。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_07"
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "noss",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "放下武器。我可以给你一张永久通行证。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_08"
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "先把其他人的通行权限恢复。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_09"
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "noss",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "权限由我批准。你也一样。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_10"
      },
      "intro_10": {
        "id": "intro_10",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "诺斯抬起手掌。金色巨手收拢指节，一柄由光凝成的长剑在他身前亮起。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "intro_11",
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "intro_11": {
        "id": "intro_11",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "那我就先停掉这里发号施令的东西。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss"
        },
        "next": "battle"
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "光轮的尖端逐一暗下。六只金手停在半空，控制终端上的封锁指令开始消退。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss_phase2"
        },
        "next": "win_02",
        "type": "stage"
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "noss_phase2",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "……没有我的命令，城市会乱。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss_phase2"
        },
        "next": "win_03"
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "先让楼下的人回家。剩下的，让他们自己谈。",
        "portraits": {
          "left": "@player",
          "right": "noss_phase2"
        },
        "next": "win_04"
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "noss_phase2",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "他们迟早还会选一个站在这里的人。",
        "portraits": {
